note How the human audits what the agent mapped. A symbol is covered when a current step overlaps its line range. uncovered lists the rest largest first, so what is left after a session is either pre-existing or something the agent judged trivial, and size says which. coverage prints covered/total per file. Derived every time, never stored, and never a check failure.

